What are Advanced Packaging Systems?
Advanced Packaging Systems represent the next evolution in semiconductor packaging - transitioning from traditional leadless chip carriers to sophisticated solutions like wafer-level packaging (WLP), 2.5D/3D IC integration, and through-silicon via (TSV) technologies. These systems serve critical functions:

Protecting delicate silicon wafers from physical damage and environmental corrosion
Enabling high-density interconnects between chips and circuit boards
Improving thermal management and power efficiency
